{
  "title": "New Napier Veterinary Clinic Now Open – Vet Services Hawke's Bay",
  "text": "New Napier Veterinary Clinic Now Open – Vet Services Hawke's Bay\nSkip to content\nOur Locations:\nNapier\nHastings\nWaipukurau\nDannevirke\nLocations\nFacebook page opens in new window\nInstagram page opens in new window\nSearch:\nVet Services Hawke's Bay\nOur Community, Our Animals\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Story\nMeet the Teams\nLeadership Team\nWaipukurau Team\nNapier Team\nHastings Team\nDannevirke Team\nCareers, Work Experience & Scholarships\nCareers and Jobs\nVet Graduate Programme\nPractical Work Experience with Vet Services\nScholarships\nCHB Farmers Veterinary Club\nCommunity Support\nPets\nDogs\nPuppy Pre-School\nCats\nPocket & Exotic Pets\nWellness Programmes\nOrthopaedic Surgery\nCanine Reproduction Services\nDental Disease\nPet Export Certificates\nEnd of Life Care\nRehabilitation Services\nEmergency Vet Care\nPet Insurance\nFarm & Lifestyle\nSheep\nSheep Conveyor Services\nSheep Reproduction Services\nSheep Scanning\nBeef\nPregnancy Testing Cows & Heifers\nDeer\nHind Scanning\nDairy\nDairy Technician Services\nMastitis Accreditation\nDairy Scanning\nWorking Dogs\nWorking Dog Performance Partnership\nWorking Dog Reproduction with Vet Services\nLifestyle\nGenetics & Reproduction\nEquine\nVS Equine\nNews & Articles\nPodcast\nFinance Options\nBonus Points\nArticles\nDownloads\nNewsletters\nEvents\nContact\nNapier\nHastings\nWaipukurau\nDannevirke\nBook Online\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Story\nMeet the Teams\nLeadership Team\nWaipukurau Team\nNapier Team\nHastings Team\nDannevirke Team\nCareers, Work Experience & Scholarships\nCareers and Jobs\nVet Graduate Programme\nPractical Work Experience with Vet Services\nScholarships\nCHB Farmers Veterinary Club\nCommunity Support\nPets\nDogs\nPuppy Pre-School\nCats\nPocket & Exotic Pets\nWellness Programmes\nOrthopaedic Surgery\nCanine Reproduction Services\nDental Disease\nPet Export Certificates\nEnd of Life Care\nRehabilitation Services\nEmergency Vet Care\nPet Insurance\nFarm & Lifestyle\nSheep\nSheep Conveyor Services\nSheep Reproduction Services\nSheep Scanning\nBeef\nPregnancy Testing Cows & Heifers\nDeer\nHind Scanning\nDairy\nDairy Technician Services\nMastitis Accreditation\nDairy Scanning\nWorking Dogs\nWorking Dog Performance Partnership\nWorking Dog Reproduction with Vet Services\nLifestyle\nGenetics & Reproduction\nEquine\nVS Equine\nNews & Articles\nPodcast\nFinance Options\nBonus Points\nArticles\nDownloads\nNewsletters\nEvents\nContact\nNapier\nHastings\nWaipukurau\nDannevirke\nNew Napier Veterinary Clinic Now Open\nArticles\nLatest News\nVet Services Napier has moved into brand new facilities at 170 Taradale Road!\nThe new Napier clinic provides the region with a large veterinary centre, with an extensive range of expertise in companion animal, production animal and equine disciplines all under one roof.\nThe state of the art veterinary clinic is fully-equipped with the latest technology and includes three operating theatres, an imaging suite, comprehensive treatment facilities, after-hours treatment rooms, a laboratory, and a separate recovery suites for canines, felines, and pocket pets. In our new retail space we now offer a large range of animal health products for pets, farm animals and horses.\nWe look forward to welcoming clients to an open day soon!\nShare this post\nShare on Facebook\nShare on Facebook\nShare on X\nShare on X\nPin it\nShare on Pinterest\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on LinkedIn\nPost navigation\nPrevious\nPrevious post:\nHighly Contagious Kennel Cough in our Community\nNext\nNext post:\nVet Services claims top Hawkes Bay Business Award 2022\nRelated News\nBarber’s Pole Worm Alert\n17 September 2026\nWorming your dog matters! Sheep Measles\n14 September 2026\nDrone Technology for Smarter Livestock Management\n7 September 2026\nNews Categories\nArticles\n(79)\nAutumn\n(24)\nBeef\n(26)\nDairy\n(30)\nDeer\n(8)\nEquine\n(14)\nFacial Eczema\n(19)\nLatest News\n(121)\nLifestyle\n(26)\nPets & Companion Animals\n(57)\nSheep\n(38)\nSpring\n(15)\nSummer\n(24)\nWinter\n(17)\nWorking Dogs\n(24)\nLatest News\nBarber’s Pole Worm Alert\n17 September 2026\nWorming your dog matters! Sheep Measles\n14 September 2026\nDrone Technology for Smarter Livestock Management\n7 September 2026\nFarm Delivery Service\n30 July 2026\nLungworm\n30 July 2026\nOh No, My Bitch Was Knotted!\n23 July 2026\nOur Locations\nNapier\n170 Taradale Road\n(06) 843 5308\nView Location\nHastings\n801 Heretaunga St West\n(06) 876 7001\nView Location\nWaipukurau\n43 Takapau Road\n(06) 858 9060\nView Location\nDannevirke\n193-195 High Street\n(06) 374 7021\nVisit Website\n© Vet Services Hawke's Bay. All rights reserved. Site by\nQuest\n.\nGo to Top",
